à e umani","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16012","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"128893","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"46569","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"117465","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"402474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"71420","synopsis":"Gabimaru abbandona il villaggio e si dirige da solo al centro dell'isola, dove trova una struttura costruita dagli umani e si scontra con un'avversaria molto tenace.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eqtEoIzqJoDSV0v9ETZayli3mPi.jpg"},{"title":"Yin e Yang","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16012","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"128893","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"46569","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"117465","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"402474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"71597","synopsis":"Dopo che l'indebolito Gabimaru si offre di collaborare con Gantetsusai e Fuchi, Mei cerca di parlare loro del Tao, la fonte dei poteri del sommo Tensen.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ApVsykHWYMpwJnx2Qrk9pfT8g7C.jpg"},{"title":"Debole e forte","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16012","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"128893","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"46569","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"117465","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"402474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"71668","synopsis":"Chobei impara a curarsi miracolosamente le ferite. Me